OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBlustery
OL,6,Fshowers and clear spells at first,
OL,7,Fwith cloud increasing during the
OL,8,Fsecond half of the night but remaining
OL,9,Fdry. The wind gradually eases to a
OL,10,Flight breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy, with rain moving in
OL,13,Ffrom the southwest. The rain clears
OL,14,Fmost places by the evening. The wind
OL,15,Fstrengthens by the afternoon,
OL,16,Fespecially over the Pennines.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
