OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FRemaining breezy, with showers on
OL,7,FTuesday. Dry but windy on Wednesday.
OL,8,FTurning increasingly settled, with
OL,9,Flighter winds by Thursday.
